THE MISSING PAGE — third-party material

MUSIC
- Original piano-and-strings score ("ambition" cue and the elevator cue): generated with ElevenLabs Music (model eleven_music_v2_5)
  on the film owner's ElevenLabs account. Use of the generated music is governed by that account's ElevenLabs plan and terms.
  Cut, ducked and level-ridden in mix.py.
- Sergei Rachmaninoff, Prelude in C-sharp minor, Op. 3 No. 2 (composition: public domain, composed 1892).
  New rendering made for this film: the opening bell octaves (A–G#–C#), the hushed chords over the tolling C#, and the fff return
  of the theme, programmed in mix.py and played on the sampled grand below. No existing recording was used.
- Piano: "Salamander Grand Piano V3" by Alexander Holm, licensed under CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)
- Sub-bass impact, the low atmospheric drop, heartbeat, clock ticks: synthesised in mix.py (original).

